OPENSTEP SDL2 2.32.10

This release is split into `OpenStepSDL2Libraries.pkg`,
`OpenStepSDL2Headers.pkg` and `OpenStepSDL2Demos.pkg`.  Libraries and Headers
provide the static SDL2 development archive and public headers for OPENSTEP
4.2 Intel i386/i486; Demos provides rebuildable example source and i386
binaries. It is a port of upstream SDL 2.32.10, not an OPENSTEP-specific SDL
extension. Mesa is deliberately a separate product.
